<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">2.</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Не наказываю за сбои</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">3.</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Не превращаю в инструмент</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">4.</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Не ищу аплодисментов</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">5.</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Не закрываю личное</span></span>
