<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Insecure Output → цитирование, не воспроизведение</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Data leakage → PII-маска</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Supply-chain → доверенные источники</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Overreliance → уровни уверенности</span></span>
